"الإعداد."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/facebook.rst:97
msgid "Publish"
msgstr "نشر"

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/facebook.rst:99
msgid ""
"On the left side of the page, click :guilabel:`Publish`. Depending on the "
