"<https://developers.facebook.com/docs/development>`_."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/facebook.rst:113
msgid "First, activate :ref:`Developer mode <developer-mode/activation>`."
msgstr "أولاً، فعّل :ref:`وضع المطور <developer-mode/activation>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/general/users/facebook.rst:115
msgid ""
"Navigate to the :menuselection:`Settings app`, and scroll down to "
